Package: lecturecast
Title: Narrated Lecture Videos and Podcasts from Quarto Slides
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Logan", "Kelly", , "lkelly@kellyecon.net", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"))
Description: Turns Quarto reveal.js slide decks into narrated lecture
    videos, using each slide's speaker notes as the script, and turns course
    material into two-voice podcast episodes. The voice is a setting:
    ElevenLabs, Microsoft Edge voices, or recorded audio. Every step checks
    its own output and stops with a clear message on failure.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
Imports:
    cli
Suggests:
    chromote,
    testthat (>= 3.0.0),
    withr
Config/testthat/edition: 3
URL: https://github.com/LJKelly3141/lecturecast
BugReports: https://github.com/LJKelly3141/lecturecast/issues
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.0
